{"author":{"id":"fd7f3dbc4355c59607d7a10ce53dc23877e6b88e93fde4f9e421c07a3df0b23b"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1791189388,"nonce":"CQpO+BOS9j/BpPW+Xv/aWoBGbIo=","metadata":{"github-url":"https://github.com/EPFL-ENAC/vps-mitsi/issues/31","origin":"github","sync:github.com/epfl-enac/vps-mitsi:id":"I_kwDOULtcMc8AAAABVEehMw","sync:github.com/epfl-enac/vps-mitsi:labels":"","sync:github.com/epfl-enac/vps-mitsi:number":"31","sync:github.com/epfl-enac/vps-mitsi:status":"open","sync:github.com/epfl-enac/vps-mitsi:text":"9aeae364edfb4656d9710623244890e6fc93de0f2408b12178ff466b7da04ddc","sync:github.com/epfl-enac/vps-mitsi:title":"[FEAT](Deployment) Choice of deployment solution : Gh Page vs. ENAC k8s pipeline","sync:github.com/epfl-enac/vps-mitsi:url":"https://github.com/EPFL-ENAC/vps-mitsi/issues/31"},"title":"[FEAT](Deployment) Choice of deployment solution : Gh Page vs. ENAC k8s pipeline","message":"## Github Pages\n\n### pros :\n- simple\n- owned by github : we don't need to manage any infrastructure ourselves\n\n### cons :\n- limited : we can't have any backend if we want to expand the features in the app that would require that\n- owned by github : dependent on github's infrastructure and if there's a problem on their side, there's nothing we can do about it\n\n\n## ENAC pipeline\n\n### pros :\n- flexible : if we need to have a backend for some future features, we can add it without a deployment migration\n- owned by us : we don't depend on any external infrastructure for this app\n\n### cons :\n- we need to manage the deployment layers ourselves\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n- with the currently planned feature set of the app, we are NOT limited by any of the 2 options\n- due to its simplicity, we generally deploy apps like MITSI on github pages\n- for any other apps, we would go to the ENAC infrastructure","files":null}]}